

ABOUT THE PRODUCT
Aroma, colour and flavour
Iranian saffron is internationally valued for its distinctive aroma, natural colour and flavour. Goodarzi Trading
offers selected Iranian saffron that undergoes sorting and cleaning before packaging. Super Negin, the longest,
thickest pure red stigmas, is our most requested grade by international buyers.
Product preparation
Our preparation process focuses on separating
unwanted materials and improving product uniformity.
Sorting may include removing yellow parts of the
stigmas Zarde), pollen and fine dust Garde), broken
stigmas, fine particles, powder and foreign materials.
Quality evaluation
Quality can be evaluated through laboratory analysis
of crocin, safranal and picrocrocin, alongside
moisture and other parameters. A batch-specific
Certificate of Analysis COA can be provided for the
relevant sealed batch.
The diagram shows how each grade is defined by the portion of the stigma it includes, from Super Negin (the longest pure red stigmas) to
Dasteh (the whole stigma bundle).
